else. It grants no rights whatsoever to any third party's intellectual
property.

That distinction is easy to miss here, because the application downloads
copyrighted material at runtime. It is worth stating plainly:

  * No card text, card images, or other Bandai material is contained in this
    repository, in any release artefact, or in any compiled binary, with one
    exception: README.md embeds a single screenshot of the running client
    (docs/screenshot.png), which necessarily shows card art fetched at
