Third-party sources
-------------------

Card data is fetched from:

  buhbbl/punk-records      https://github.com/buhbbl/punk-records
    Static, versioned JSON generated from the official card list. Pinned to a
    specific commit; see `op_ingest::SOURCE_REF`.

  Coko7/vegapull           https://github.com/Coko7/vegapull
    The scraper that produces the above, reading en.onepiece-cardgame.com.

Rules are implemented against the publicly published ONE PIECE CARD GAME
Comprehensive Rules. Rule numbers are cited throughout the source as
references; no rules text is reproduced wholesale.

Rust dependencies retain their own licences; see `cargo tree` or the
`Cargo.lock` for the full set.
